        }
      }
    },
    "Belum ada data untuk dicadangkan. Cadangan dibuat setelah kamu mulai mencatat." : {
      "comment" : "Pengaturan: the app has no data yet and the folder has no backup, so nothing is written until the first entry.",
      "localizations" : {
