    },
    "Belum ada pengeluaran di %@" : {
      "comment" : "Analisis empty state title when the month has no expenses. The placeholder is the month, e.g. 'November 2026'.\nYearly recap when the year has income but no expenses. The placeholder is the year, e.g. '2026'.",
