    },
    "Belum dipilih. Pilih folder, misalnya di iCloud Drive, agar cadangan tetap ada walau aplikasi dihapus." : {
      "comment" : "Pengaturan: under the backup folder row when no folder is chosen yet (automatic backup is off).",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
