      "comment" : "Tab bar: the Home tab, with the month's totals and pinned cards.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Home"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Berkas data apa adanya, untuk diperbaiki nanti. Berkas ini bukan cadangan, jadi tidak bisa dipakai untuk Pulihkan dari cadangan." : {
      "comment" : "Store error screen, under Simpan salinan berkas data: the raw files as they are, for a later repair. Not a backup, so Pulihkan dari cadangan can't use them.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The data files as they are, for a later repair. They aren't a backup, so Restore from backup can't use them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Berkas ini bukan cadangan Kemanaya yang valid. Datamu tidak berubah." : {
      "comment" : "Inline error: the picked file is not a valid Kemanaya backup. Nothing was changed.",
      "localizations" : {
