          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nothing logged this month"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cadangan & Ekspor" : {
      "comment" : "Pengaturan: header of the backup and export section.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Backup & export"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cadangan berisi semua datamu: transaksi, kategori, pin, anggaran, dan rekap bulanan. Simpan di iCloud Drive agar tetap aman walau aplikasi dihapus." : {
      "comment" : "Pengaturan: footer of the backup and export section, explaining what a backup holds and why iCloud Drive.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A backup holds all your data: transactions, categories, pins, budgets and monthly recaps. Keep it in iCloud Drive so it stays safe even if the app is deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cadangan dari %@ berisi %lld transaksi. Semua data di aplikasi ini akan diganti." : {
      "comment" : "Restore alert message. 1: when the backup was made, e.g. '20 November 2026 14.05'. 2: how many transactions it holds. Everything in the app is replaced.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The backup from %1$@ holds %#@transactions@. All data in this app will be replaced."
          },
          "substitutions" : {
            "transactions" : {
              "argNum" : 2,
              "formatSpecifier" : "lld",
              "variations" : {
                "plural" : {
                  "one" : {
                    "stringUnit" : {
                      "state" : "translated",
                      "value" : "%arg transaction"
                    }
                  },
                  "other" : {
                    "stringUnit" : {
                      "state" : "translated",
                      "value" : "%arg transactions"
